MODIFICATION NOTICE

This is a modified version of context-mode 1.0.169, originally licensed by
Mert Koseoğlu under the Elastic License 2.0. The original license is included
in LICENSE.

The local version removes update discovery, automatic installation/repair,
model-callable upgrade/browser/destructive tools, and implicit persistent-data
retention cleanup. It forces strict public-network fetch policy and strips
credential and code-injection environment variables from active child-process
boundaries. The exact modified TypeScript is retained under source/ and the
runtime artifacts are rebuilt from it.
